<title>HUNGARY: Cofinec group IAS Q1 pre-tax profit dips.</title>
<headline>Cofinec group IAS Q1 pre-tax profit dips.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three-month period ending March 31.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>					 Jan-March 1997   Jan-March 1996</p>
<p>    Group operating profit	    11.7     vs     15.8</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		 5.7     vs	7.2</p>
<p>    Group net sales		    183.7     vs    172.7</p>
<p>    Direct costs of sales	    144.4     vs    131.0</p>
